---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Orbit Web Designs & Marketing" description="Orbit Web Designs & Marketing Privacy Policy — how we collect, use, and protect your data.">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Data We Collect</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Contact form submissions: name, email, phone, project details</li>
          <li>Analytics data: IP address, browser, device, pages visited (via Google Analytics 4)</li>
          <li>Marketing data: Meta Pixel events (WhatsApp clicks, form submissions)</li>
          <li>Technical data: browser type, OS, referrer, timestamps</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Respond to inquiries and provide quotes</li>
          <li>Deliver and improve our services</li>
          <li>Send project updates and service communications</li>
          <li>Analyze website performance and user behavior</li>
          <li>Run marketing campaigns (Meta/Google ads) with your consent</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Data Sharing</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>We do not sell your personal data</li>
          <li>Shared with: Vercel (hosting), Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, WhatsApp Business API</li>
          <li>Only shared with third parties when required by law</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">4. Your Rights (Kenya Data Protection Act)</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Access your personal data</li>
          <li>Request correction or deletion</li>
          <li>Object to processing</li>
          <li>Data portability</li>
          <li>Lodge complaint with Office of the Data Protection Commissioner (ODPC)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">5. Data Retention</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">Contact form data: retained for 2 years. Analytics data: 26 months (GA4 default). Marketing data: until you opt out.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">6. Security</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">Static site architecture — no database, no server-side processing. HTTPS enforced, CSP, HSTS, security headers enforced.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:mwmwai@gmail.com" class="text-electric hover:underline">mwmwai@gmail.com</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/254741992308" class="text-electric hover:underline">0741 992 308</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>